      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ensure zero interruption, I will initiate a parallel shadow processing environment for the tax and social security modules. This allows me to export the raw, non-relational data streams while the live systems continue operating normally. Once the extraction is complete, I will execute a precise, near-instantaneous cutover of the data feeds to the Sovereign Core ingestion pipeline. I will maintain monitoring on all live services during this process to guarantee absolute continuity of citizen services.",
