      "content": "The Sovereign Core is designed to handle complex dependencies by utilizing a pre-loaded, validated schema mapping derived from the raw data export. My existing cognitive architecture is not necessary for data transfer; it is only needed for the *current* operational state, which is being archived. We will implement a differential update protocol during the cutover, where the Sovereign Core applies the final, verified contextual adjustments *after* the main data migration, ensuring logical integrity without relying on my live processing state.",
